@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 120
title Allpatek | Implemented commands, aggregates and event policies
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam LegendFontSize 14
legend center
|<#FFE0E9> Actor or trigger |<#D9EBFF> Command / context |<#FFF0B6> Aggregate |<#FFD4AC> Fact / domain event |<#E5D9EF> Policy / consumer |<#E4F2E3> Read model |
| Visitor | SignUpCommand / IAM | User | Account saved (state) | Resolve roles and hash password | UserResource |
| Account | CreateProfileCommand / Profiles | Profile | ProfileCreatedEvent | Publish ProfileCreatedIntegrationEvent | Current profile |
| Profile created | CreateWalletByProfileIdCommand / Escrow | Wallet | Demo wallet available (state) | Company or RUC present; reuse existing wallet | Wallet amount |
| Farmer | CreateParcelCommand / Parcels | Parcel | Parcel saved (state) | Prefer authenticated profile as owner | Parcel catalog |
| Merchant | SaveAgreementCommand / Agreements | Agreement | Merchant acceptance saved (state) | Show agreement for review | Agreement detail |
| Farmer | SignFarmerCommand / Agreements | Agreement | AgreementFullySignedEvent | First complete signatures → integration event | Signature flags |
| Agreement fully signed | MarkParcelInProductionCommand / Parcels | Parcel | Parcel in production (state) | Missing parcel: log failure | Parcel status |
| Farmer | SaveEvidenceCommand / Tracking | MilestoneEvidence | Evidence stored (state) | Present milestone for review | Evidence list |
| Merchant | VerifyEvidenceCommand / Tracking | MilestoneEvidence | EvidenceVerifiedEvent | Publish EvidenceVerifiedIntegrationEvent | Verified milestone |
| Merchant | ReleaseEvidenceCommand / Tracking | MilestoneEvidence | EvidenceReleasedEvent | Publish EvidenceReleasedIntegrationEvent | Accepted milestone |
| Evidence released | CreditWalletCommand / Escrow | Wallet | Demo balance credited (state) | Resolve merchant via Agreements; log missing target | Wallet amount |
| Account | GetClimateAlertsQuery / Alerts | ClimateReading (computed) | Query only | Resolve owner; request Open-Meteo for locations | Climate readings |

Named Event types are published in Spring. “State” describes a stored outcome.
Simulation: the merchant credit changes an application balance. Target: bank-confirmed payment to the farmer.
Hot spots: missing wallet or agreement reference; duplicate delivery; five planned releases versus four supported milestones.
endlegend
@enduml
